  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Ta có hình vuông thứ nhất có cạnh bằng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>1</mn></semantics></math>,\n\t\t\thình vuông thứ hai có cạnh bằng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></semantics></math>.<br>Hình vuông thứ ba có cạnh bằng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></semantics></math>.<br>Suy ra\thình vuông thứ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>n</mi></semantics></math> có cạnh bằng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></semantics></math>.<br>Diện tích của hình vuông thứ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>n</mi></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Tổng diện tích của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>n</mi></semantics></math> hình vuông đầu tiên là tổng của cấp số nhân có  số hạng đầu <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math> và công bội <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> nên\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\t<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>→</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>∞</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>→</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>∞</mi></mrow></munder><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><munder><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>→</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>∞</mi></mrow></munder><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><munder><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>→</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>∞</mi></mrow></munder><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Hình vuông thứ nhất có chu vi bằng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>4</mn></semantics></math>, hình vuông thứ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>2</mn></semantics></math> có chu vi là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>, hình vuông thứ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>3</mn></semantics></math> có chu vi là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>2</mn></semantics></math>.<br>Suy ra hình vuông thứ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>n</mi></semantics></math> có chu vi bằng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.\n\t\t\tTổng chu vi của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>n</mi></semantics></math> hình vuông đầu tiên là tổng của cấp số nhân có  số hạng đầu <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></semantics></math> và công bội <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> nên \n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\t<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>→</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>∞</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><munder><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>→</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>∞</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ol>",
